This is an example project to demonstrate using
BubbleScript with Express for Node.

This is currently experimental and in
development, so please mind any messes, and few
free to fork and contribute changes and
improvements. All are welcome and appreciated.

Currently, we create an index.js files that does
some currently neccesary setup, and then we load
the index.bubls file which does the Express
configuaration.

This can probably be improved in future release
by creating a compiler plugin for node, like
coffeescript does.

In the index.js file we provided the require
function and the loadScript function. These are
realy just patches and will have proper support
un future versions of BubbleScript, for the time
being, this is all that is required to get this
basic example of using e press with BubbleScript
working.

Cheers and Happy Coding!

x💋x💋 Bambi

